Phase.Step:
Generate the complete session in dependency order with: form cues
        for every exercise; RPE guidance; regression and progression options;
        hydration reminders at least twice for sessions over 10 minutes;
        "Coach Says" motivational callouts between exercises and sets;
        physiological "why" explanations for key exercises; specific
        post-workout food examples with timing; a Coach's Challenge at the end.

ErrorRecoveryProtocol.Recovery:
Re-run Sub-problem 2 or Sub-problem 4 against the revised main block;
do not leave a warm-up that no longer matches what it is meant to
prepare.
